{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Puzzle Adventure That\u2019s as Cozy as a Warm Cup of Tea!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Ringo\u2019s Roundup</i>, you join <strong>Ringo, the fluffiest postbunny in town</strong>, on his <strong>mail delivery adventure</strong>! But there\u2019s a twist\u2014Ringo <strong>doesn\u2019t control his car directly</strong>. Instead, YOU <strong>plan his route</strong> by carefully placing <strong>Effect Tiles</strong> on the road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level is a charming <strong>pathfinding puzzle</strong>, where your goal is to <strong>collect all the envelopes in the right order and drop them off at the mailbox</strong>. But be careful! The road is full of twists, turns, and obstacles, and you\u2019ll need to <strong>experiment, strategize, and adapt</strong> to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769290/extras/Basic_Gameplay_smallest.gif?t=1741866961\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Simple Mechanics, Endless Possibilities!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Ringo\u2019s Roundup</i> starts off easy, but as you progress, you\u2019ll discover <strong>unexpected depth</strong> in its puzzle mechanics! Each <strong>Effect Tile</strong> has a unique function, and when combined, they create <strong>exciting new challenges</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769290/extras/Jumps_smallest.gif?t=1741866961\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude80 <strong>JUMP</strong> \u2013 Bounce over obstacles and tricky terrain!<br>\ud83d\udd2e <strong>PORTALS</strong> \u2013 Teleport across the level for creative solutions!<br>\ud83e\uddf2 <strong>MAGNETS</strong> \u2013 Push or pull objects to clear the way!<br>\ud83d\uded1 <strong>Direction Tiles</strong> \u2013 Control turns and set the perfect path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every puzzle has <strong>multiple solutions</strong>, rewarding both careful planning and playful experimentation. No two players will find the same path\u2014so <strong>challenge yourself to discover the smartest, most creative routes!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769290/extras/Magnets_smallest.gif?t=1741866961\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love Ringo\u2019s Roundup</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714\ufe0f <strong>100 handcrafted levels</strong> with carefully designed puzzles<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Chill, stress-free gameplay</strong> \u2013 No timers, no pressure!<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Multiple solutions for many levels</strong> \u2013 Play your way!<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Adorable customization</strong> \u2013 Unlock new car colors for Ringo!<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>A cozy, colorful world</strong> full of charm and personality<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>A cute bunny postman</strong> on a wholesome journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Perfect for puzzle lovers, cozy gamers, and anyone looking for a charming, relaxing experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hop in, start planning, and <strong>help Ringo deliver the mail in the most delightful way possible!</strong> \ud83d\udc30\ud83d\udcec</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769290/extras/Portals_smallest.gif?t=1741866961\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Postbunny Ringo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2769290/ecc6d69bb6dfae21dc407ab017504b3967ee728b.jpg"},{"name":"Starting Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/